@h3 t2va 16:9
style: live-action, nature documentary footage
$beast = __creature[deep_sea]__

SHOT 5s | tracking, slow
Deep underwater, darkness except for a faint blue glow. A $beast drifts into the beam of a submersible's searchlight, marine snow falling around it.
NARRATOR (calm, low British male voice, voiceover): At this depth, sunlight is only a rumour.
SFX: a sonar ping repeats; the submersible's motors hum low

SHOT 4s | cut, push in, small, slow
A close-up of the $beast as faint blue and violet light pulses slowly along its body.
NARRATOR (voiceover): And yet, the $beast makes its own.
SFX: a muffled, slow pulse throbs like a heartbeat

MUSIC: a sustained analog synth pad at a slow tempo, very quiet, with a deep bass note entering halfway
